      564.55,
      548.44,
      689.98
    ],
    "text": "Winds: Winds will be North-easterly in the sea areas around the island. Wind speed will be (25-35) kmph. Wind speed can increase up to (40-45) kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Chilaw to Mullaitivu via Mannar, and from Hambantota to Pottuvil. State of Sea: The sea areas off the coast extending from Chilaw to Mullaitivu via Mannar and from Hambantota to Pottuvil will be fairly rough at times. The other sea areas around the island will be moderate. Temporarily strong gusty winds and very rough seas can be expected during thundershowers.",
